      "text": "Cooking for other people has a value that goes beyond feeding them. Preparing a meal thinking about someone else's tastes is, in a way, a silent gesture of affection. A special occasion is not always needed to do it. Sometimes, a simple dish shared at home is worth more than an elaborate dinner at a restaurant.",
